  "pages": 7
 },
 "summary": "Single Zener diodes for voltage stabilisation in a hermetically sealed glass MicroMELF (SOD-80) body, rated 500 mW. Nominal voltages run from 2.4 V to 75 V, in two tolerance groups: C parts with a wider and B parts with a narrower zener voltage window. Zener voltage is specified with a pulsed test current of 5 mA (2.5 mA from 39 V up). BZM55C5V6-TR is the 5.6 V C-group part (5.2 V to 6.0 V) on a 7-inch reel of 2500.",
 "key_figures": [
  [
   "Power dissipation Ptot",
   "500 mW (RthJA ≤ 300 K/W, Tamb = 25 °C)"
  ],
  [
   "Zener voltage range, nominal",
   "2.4 V to 75 V"
  ],
  [
   "Test current IZT",
   "5 mA (2V4 to 36); 2.5 mA (39 to 75)"
  ],
  [
   "BZM55C5V6 zener voltage",
   "5.2 V min, 5.6 V nom, 6 V max at IZT1 = 5 mA"
  ],
  [
   "BZM55C5V6 dynamic resistance",
   "ZZ < 40 Ω at 5 mA; ZZK < 450 Ω at 1 mA, f = 1 kHz"
  ],
  [
   "BZM55C5V6 reverse current",
   "< 0.1 µA at 25 °C, < 2 µA at 125 °C, VR = 1 V"
  ],
  [
   "Forward voltage VF",
   "1.5 V at IF = 200 mA"
  ],
  [
   "Junction temperature",
   "175 °C"
  ],
  [
   "Package",
   "MicroMELF (SOD-80), approx. 12 mg"
  ]
